# Pin LF line endings for files that are byte-compared in tests or by
# `make generate-check`. Without this, Git's default autocrlf behaviour on
# Windows checkouts converts LF to CRLF, breaking golden-file equality
# checks (the renderer always emits LF) and producing spurious CRLF/LF
# diffs in `git diff --exit-code` after `go generate`.
common/skill/render/testdata/** text eol=lf
**/internal/skill/bundle/** text eol=lf
**/internal/skill/additions.md text eol=lf
**/internal/skill/description.txt text eol=lf
